# raw/ holds large, regenerable intermediates (tools/gen_enemies.py +
# tools/merge_enemy_anim.py): the meshes, rigged bind poses, walk/run/attack clips,
# and the Godot .import sidecars + extracted textures they spawned before this dir was
# .gdignore'd. Godot skips this dir (.gdignore), so none of it is needed in-engine -
# the final <enemy>.glb one level up is what the game imports. Keep only the small
# fal.ai response JSONs for reference.
*
!.gitignore
!.gdignore
!*_response.json
